text LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_4F_Text_FiftyDifferentTMs {
    format("There are so many different kinds of\nTM moves.\pA catalog I read said there are fifty\ndifferent kinds.$")
}

text LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_4F_Text_AttackOrDefenseTM {
    format("Hmm…\pAn attacking move…\nOr a defensive move…\pIt's no easy matter to decide which TM\nmoves should be taught to POKéMON…$")
}

text LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_4F_Text_PokemonOnlyHaveFourMoves {
    format("I'd like to get all the different TMs,\nbut a POKéMON learns only four moves.$")
}
